CREATE TABLE rivers AS
    SELECT waterways.name, ST_Union(geom) AS geom
    FROM waterways
    WHERE waterways.fclass = 'river' AND waterways.name IS NOT NULL
    GROUP BY waterways.name

Sljedećim upitom dobivamo rijeke i njihov isoFactor:
SELECT rivers.name, 100 * (SUM(st_area(buildings.geom)) / st_area(st_buffer(rivers.geom, 100))) AS isoFactor
FROM rivers JOIN buildings ON ST_DWithin(rivers.geom, buildings.geom, 100)
GROUP BY rivers.name, rivers.geom
ORDER BY isoFactor DESC;

Najmanje izolirana rijek je rijeka Jadro.
U QGis-u sam prvo dodala layer state i layer rivers.
Isto kao u prethodnom zadataku, odabrala sam Symbology Rule Based opciju i dodala sljedeću filter: "name"='Jadro'.
U oba podzadatka dodala sam i labels.


CREATE TABLE forest_percent AS
WITH forst_county AS (
    SELECT county.name_1, county.geom, ST_Intersection(county.geom, landuse.geom) AS p
    FROM county JOIN landuse ON landuse.fclass = 'forest'
)
SELECT name_1, geom, ROUND(SUM(ST_Area(p)) / ST_Area(geom) * 100) || '%' AS p
FROM forst_county
GROUP BY name_1, geom;

Tablica forest_percent ima 3 stupca, ime zupanije, geom zupanije i udio šuma u površini županije u obliku postotka.
   
U QGisu sam u layer stavila upravo tu tablicu.
Symbiology sam postavila na opciju Categorized, Value na p, tako da se boje određuju baš po tom postotku. Za Color map sam odabrala greens.
   
Za labels je bilo potrebno odabrati Single labels, a za Value sam odabrala Expression: "name_1" +  ', p=' + "p".


CREATE TABLE hospitals AS
SELECT name, geom, ST_Centroid(pois_a.geom) c
FROM pois_a
WHERE pois_a.fclass = 'hospital';

SQL kodom sam napravila centroide za klasu 'hospital'.
Zatim sam centroide i county prikazala na karti.
Nakon toga sam u Processingc Toolboxu odabrala Vector Geometry i u layers dodala Voroni polygons, a u opciju Input layer sam stavila hospitals.c.
Na kraju sam trebala smanjiti opcaity na layeru Voroni polygons kako bi se vidjela karta s bolnicama ispod. 
